</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">885e5f70-8292-11f1-8e08-a5722f6cb7a9</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 10:22:08 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg">AFP - AARON FAVILA</source><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>美国对巴新下令关闭台湾在该国驻处的报道“深表关切”</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260718-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%B9%E5%B7%B4%E5%B8%83%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%A4%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E9%A9%BB%E8%AF%A5%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%A5%E9%81%93-%E6%B7%B1%E8%A1%A8%E5%85%B3%E5%88%87</link><description>
